# EASY TRAV — LOCKED CORE DESIGN SYSTEM

This rule is authoritative for **all Easy Trav visual design**.

`CLAUDE.md` remains authoritative for architecture, engineering, security, TypeScript, performance, and repository rules.

If a future prompt conflicts with this visual system: **stop, flag the conflict, and ask before breaking it.** Do not silently follow the conflicting instruction.

Do not redesign Easy Trav. Evolve within this system.

---

## 1. Brand positioning

Easy Trav is a **premium global travel and lifestyle brand**.

Closer to: private aviation, five-star hospitality, luxury concierge, premium travel clubs, bespoke tour operators, high-end lifestyle brands, private banking / premium membership.

Never: Booking.com, Expedia, Skyscanner, generic travel templates, SaaS dashboards, fintech apps, startup landing pages, WordPress themes, cheap Egypt-tour sites.

Emotional qualities: exclusive, cinematic, editorial, refined, warm, premium, bespoke, global, trusted, VIP, mature, effortless, personal.

Core promise: **TRAVEL MADE EASY**.

